**Read:** [Non-ferrous Extractive Metallurgy — Ray and Pugazhenthy, NPTEL](../sources/Nonferrous-Extractive-Metallurgy-NPTEL.lingua#r_29G1ZF58Y8EG123MNX3ZRNRE2W), the entire aluminium and related extraction/refining programme; [Non-ferrous Metals Industries — European Commission BREF](../sources/Nonferrous-Metals-Industries-BREF.lingua#r_19ZD7KKDWVWM20MXVNCQZJMCDB), whole aluminium, electrodes, secondary-production, and shared utility/residual chapters; [Aluminium Automotive Manual — European Aluminium and collaborators](../sources/Aluminium-Automotive-Manual.lingua#r_73MPKA19MDBSQ96195B818Z49T), all four named technical categories and full selected functional cases; [Metals, alloys, steels, and graduate modeling — Bhadeshia teaching materials](../sources/Metals-Alloys-and-Graduate-Teaching-Bhadeshia.lingua#r_0HZJKN8WC6SEWA0DABM8P4HC3F), the complete aluminium/precipitation/joining and relevant advanced methods; [Metal Recycling: Opportunities, Limits, Infrastructure — UNEP International Resource Panel](../sources/Metal-Recycling-UNEP-IRP.lingua#r_40JXFY43ST442BB8MJEAYJT9N1), the full quality and product-system recovery account.

Select a specified cast or wrought product and reconstruct complete primary and secondary-feed routes to it. Read the full relevant nonferrous/extraction courses, aluminium and electrode technical chapters, and complete Materials, Products, Manufacturing, and Joining sections of the aluminium manual. Read the full primary studies behind the actual alloy/process/property claims.

Join feed/mineral or scrap characterization, alumina/intermediate production where relevant, cell or remelting/refining, impurity/gas/oxide behavior, casting, deformation/treatment, joining/surface, and inspection. Preserve target/impurity, electrode/reagent, water, energy/heat, residual, inventory, and time accounts on matched product-quality boundaries.

Independently reproduce a significant chemical/electrical/energy account and a structure/property or processing calculation. Validate against independent material/operating observations, compare a changed feed/alloy-mix or thermal history, and investigate competing explanations for a consequential defect or property discrepancy.

**Work:** defend alternatives through accepted product, useful recovery, contamination/defect control, thermal/electrical and water/gas systems, tooling/maintenance, labor, residuals, and uncertainty. Explain which claimed benefit survives changed boundary/quality assumptions and which does not. Specify the most discriminating experiment or pilot/operating evidence required next, distinguishing actual practical demonstration from literature/software interpretation.

**Continue:** [Compare complete copper production routes through quality, physical models, and independent evidence](Advanced-copper-sulfide-solution-and-recycled-route-study.lingua#r_0X551ZZCB67XKG8QRYS6HDYGDG).

**Return:** [Metals and metallurgical production — feed, refining, structure, useful products, and recovery](../Metals-and-metallurgical-production.lingua#r_59BDAQXT81552YF5F8TH4KQQH1).
